d_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","review_id":"xJCod3Yz-rPLQ7OmHrBasQ","date":"2021-09-28T21:52:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9514917135238647,"text_excerpt":"Our dining experience could be summarized by the following two-word phrases: Impeccable service. (Hats off to Sara -- she was phenomenal!) Espresso martinis. These folks could serve me char on a platter and I would eat it happily! You feel like royalty from the moment the doors to the Four Seasons are opened for you. Table service is coordinated like the symphony orchestra. The espresso martinis were a special of the night but I intend to ask for these on my next visit regardless. Kent, behind the bar, made an excellent Sazarac and La Louisiana (he described this as a notch up from the Sazarac) from my +1 while we waited for our table. Additionally, the decor is stunning all over -- from ..."},{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","review_id":"0DGr1vOV1pHQbs_y77HfHQ","date":"2021-09-19T15:45:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9364026784896851,"text_excerpt":"Truly an amazing and exquisite dining experience! Chef Elon Shaya and the entire Miss River team have created a flavorful New Orleans menu and thoughtful craft cocktails. We started with the New Orleans Rum punch, which was equally balanced in flavor, sweetness, and strength. As a result, we each enjoyed two of these cocktails! Our meal included: Crab au gratin, Whole carved buttermilk fried chicken with sauces, red beans and rice, and baked sweet potato. The crab au gratin was my least favorite item. It was good, but quite an expensive appetizer. While the crab meat itself was sweet, succulent, and fresh, the serving size (approximately 6 ounces) for $18 was a bit rich. Also, the au grat..."},{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","review_id":"Z8p68Gdvq5Hdt20kjSCvqw","date":"2021-11-20T21:35:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9268889427185059,"text_excerpt":"Miss River is beautiful inside! The staff is very friendly & personable. Made our experience that much better. Also, the food is superb! We enjoyed everything we had! Will definitely be back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","photo_id":"Ysod3DkZTw0OwsSOyafz7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ysod3DkZTw0OwsSOyafz7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8902894258499146},{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","photo_id":"RWDSMyQshr36VrlnX4xt5Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/RWDSMyQshr36VrlnX4xt5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8635830879211426},{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","photo_id":"qnleWVpfiuGauaQzosheQw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qnleWVpfiuGauaQzosheQw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8409856557846069},{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","photo_id":"ypGkgYAwmYFxVSwyoEEoZg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ypGkgYAwmYFxVSwyoEEoZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.811579167842865},{"business_id":"1DxIGnI4mDDJyeIPkHemnw","photo_id":"em57Hp5UVjpzFN_DDFstWg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/em57Hp5UVjpzFN_DDFstWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8002495169639587}]},"notebook_case":null}
